    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12063" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπήμαντος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>unharmed, unhurt,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				19.282
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Th.</u>
				955
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. βίοτος</span> a life <i>free
				from misery,</i> Pi.O.<i><span class="en">
				8.87
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔστω δ᾽ ἀπήμαντον</span> be
				<i>misery far away,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				378
			</span></i> (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <i>unharming,</i>
			
