					Id.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					576
				</span></i>
			(lyr.); of snakes, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				492
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span> Tz.ad <i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				886
			</span></i>.</div>
